# A short press turns it on and ARMS the encoder. Pressed again while armed,
# it steps -- the other way from last time, so up from the start -- every
# 300 ms while held, and the press itself is not a press: it does not turn
# the dimmer off. 300..1290 held: steps at 600, 900 and 1200.
0      Din1=0
100    Din1=1
150    Din1=0
300    Din1=1
1290   Din1=0
